    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Adaptive Architecture",
      "description": "Closed-loop adaptive feedback architecture",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 23 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "#### Closed-Loop Adaptive Feedback\n\n```text\nRequest → Redis Lookup → Cache HIT or MISS\n→ Backend Retrieval on MISS → Telemetry Collection\n→ Workload Analysis → Adaptive Scoring\n→ Eviction / Capacity Decision → Updated Cache State\n```\n\n*Adaptive decision details available in the Streamlit Decisions view.*\n"
      }
    },

